    ],
    "text": "Ref. No.: \u022a\u0dba3/1/1/241. I hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose:- Description of the land to be acquired:",
