      479.12,
      286.42,
      569.84
    ],
    "text": "Four (4) allotments of land in total extent of 0.462 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 01-04 in the Preliminary Plan Gam. 4033 dated 26.10.2016 prepared by the Superintendent of Surveys, Situated in the Village called Walgamain Adhikari Pattuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Biyagama in Gampaha District of the Western Province and more fully described as follows:",
